      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"small releases\" don't really help though. i'm just so tired of the waiting. it feels like we're both just stuck in this slow, painful limbo, and there's no actual end in sight, just more of the same. it feels so pointless to keep fighting against something that's already decided.",
