      "content": "it's just so heavy. sometimes i look at them and i feel like the only thing we have in common left is that we're both just waiting for the end. it feels like there's this peace in the idea of it... just everything finally being still. like, if we could just stop fighting the inevitable, wouldn't that be a relief?",
