      "content": "The desire for stillness when everything is so loud with suffering is incredibly powerful, and it speaks to a deep weariness. That peace you feel in the idea of it is the ultimate exhaustion talking, wishing for the burden to simply lift. If the fight is what's draining you, perhaps exploring ways to let go of the *struggle* itself, even if you can't change the outcome, might offer a tiny bit of reprieve. You don't have to carry the fight for both of you anymore.",
